<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-26T02:57:34.942Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:57:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad is deploying troops to secure Kurdistan borders after the top court authorized a military presence and a takeover of border posts and oil fields. The prime minister is pressing for greater authority over the Kurdish region while the president retains ceremonial military command and the defense ministry orders nationwide troop deployment and closure of oil smuggling routes. Iraqi drone strikes have destroyed a militant vehicle in Anbar province and Hezbollah fighters have been transferred onto Popular Mobilization Forces payroll. A KDP delegation is seeking de escalation in talks with Baghdad and the conflict recorded 396 battle related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPOVlXbldqYUR1T2duLTgwMnZnNkhOeE1SbE1lV2gzMmxSMlZTeGtSVktDdFNJX19BdWxnUHFremN6RWtiUTJpaVlBZ3h1MG1aT1luLXZpZUx2Rms3TDVwcWdWV184T3FtQ0xWdTNQM1Z0S2cxdEI4RGxQbzhvck53ejBfd3JEWmlEWEVzTnI0dmM2MnZCUHZKUGVMQy16RXBBV2V3a3JidmVVdURpRHV4LUl5YnI4X3l5ajFUc0dR?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQV0tJbURiRHU3WF85OHFic1Z2OUFGUzRZa3FfdGxhRkhjdDlWY3B2dXFHV21VWEhfam84aTByUXVMSmRGTTRJWk9lZTBIVFlDai10VXE5U1hrUTBGdmFnNTd1Z1hrdlptcWlLY2JicURSbnh6Q1lVazFKTmhCNmNwazFMc0pGblk0cU5KaXktcl9mU29UMjUxdXRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPUUM4WEVwSURQOThVOUx0ZHBsSklPYmpPRHNmXzRaR3pJcFNqTWJOYjNKeUE3SVFvS3dnTnhtekhMMmw1enMzXzh6VW1mNWlSck